Build-time only (not distributed with soniq2fa): the extension is compiled
against jars of the Carbonio CE installation, which are loaded from it at run
time and are not part of this repository or of soniq2fa.jar:

- Carbonio CE mailbox (mailbox, zm-common, zm-client,
  mailbox-attribute-manager): GPL-2.0-only
- JavaMail 1.4.5: CDDL-1.0 OR GPL-2.0-only WITH Classpath-exception-2.0
- Java Servlet API 3.1: CDDL-1.1 OR GPL-2.0-only WITH Classpath-exception-2.0
- Apache HttpClient / HttpCore 4 (compile time only, for the session cookie
  API of the mailbox): Apache-2.0
- Jetty 9.4 / 12 (used through reflection, not compiled against):
  EPL-1.0 / EPL-2.0 OR Apache-2.0

Base32 is implemented in soniq2fa itself; Apache Commons Codec is not used.
