Settings module in install/settings/ run inside pages of the Carbonio CE web
interface (carbonio-login-ui, carbonio-admin-login-ui,
carbonio-admin-console-ui, carbonio-shell-ui), which are licensed
AGPL-3.0-only by Zextras S.r.l. soniq2fa is licensed GPL-2.0-or-later, so these
parts may be combined with that code under GPL-3.0 as AGPL-3.0 section 13
allows. soniq2fa does not include or modify the Carbonio web interface code;
login-inject.sh only adds a script tag to its index.html files on the server.
